        // sticky bit (sbit). The rbit is the bit immediately before the
        // z.prec leading mantissa bits (the "0.5"). The sbit is set if any
        // of the bits before the rbit are set (the "0.25", "0.125", etc.):
        // rbit  sbit  => "fractional part"
